Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 12986
Maintainer: CTTP Direction des Études Techniques
Priority: optional
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Description: CTTP-compliant pavement reinforcement design tool
 Production-ready pavement reinforcement design application following the Algerian CTTP Guide des Renforcements (Dec 1992). Computes traffic classes, deflection corrections, and reinforcement structures with full traceability and AI-powered distress detection.
